                                                    107 ***********************************************************************
                                                    108 * (pending     E788 VEVAL  - Vector Evaluate
                                                    109 *  inclusion in SATK ASAM)
                                                    110 *
                                                    111 *     VEVAL Macro to help build VEVAL instruction
                                                    112 *        VEVAL   i5
                                                    113 *
                                                    114 *        Note: v1, v2, v3, v4 are fixed vector registers:
                                                    115 *                         v1 = 1; v2 = 2, v3 = 3, v4 = 4
                                                    116 ***********************************************************************
                                                    117          MACRO
                                                    118          VEVAL   &I5
                                                    119 .*                                     &i5  - i5 for VEVAL instruction
                                                    120          LCLA  &II5
                                                    121 &II5     SETA  +(+&I5)
                                                    122                                                                SPACE 1
                                                    123          DS    0H                      E788 VEVAL
                                                    124          DC    X'E7'                   - Vector Evaluate
                                                    125          DC    X'12'                    v1, v2
                                                    126          DC    X'30'                    v3, reserved
                                                    127          DC    HL1'&II5'                i5
                                                    128          DC    x'40'                    v4, RXB
                                                    129          DC    X'88'
                                                    130                                                                SPACE 1
                                                    131          MEND
